{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00184","headline":"赐棃李泌与诸王联句 · 肃宗皇帝","name":"赐棃李泌与诸王联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生年几许，颜色似童儿。\n夜抱九仙骨，朝披一品衣。\n不食千锺粟，唯餐两颗棃。\n天生此间气，助我化无爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"肃宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}